{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p44-6f2d928f","text":"Steady state while online: 2 probes in 40s (one manually triggered + the 30s healthy recheck) and no WebSocket errors. The 400 responses are the intentional empty-path probe (documented in code) — the browser logs them as "Failed to load resource: 400", which is console noise. It's benign but noisy: every 30s the console gets a 400 error line. Could I make the probe quieter? 

