## Isolation evidence (item 6)

Account A (`alpha@marketlab.dev`): watchlist "Alpha Only" holding `NSE:TCS:EQUITY`, saved screen "Alpha Screen", TCS chart interval `1M`.

Account B (`beta@marketlab.dev`): Watchlists showed "No watchlists yet", Screener "No saved screens yet", TCS chart `1D` (default) — none of A's state visible.

Direct API calls as B using B's own real JWT (no fabricated identity):

```
watchlists:list      → success, []
watchlists:remove  {id: A's watchlist} → "Not authorized" (requireOwnedWatchlist, convex/watchlists.ts:49)
