## Bugs found and fixed during the audit

1. **Generated API was circular** — `screener.ts` called its own module via `internal.screener.candidates`, so `api.d.ts` self-referenced and TypeScript silently degraded *every* `internal.*` result to `{}` (16 real type errors, plus two masked data-shape bugs). Moved the query to [`marketStore.ts`](marketlab/convex/marketStore.ts) as `screenerCandidates` and annotated the action handlers with the client result contracts in [`marketData.ts`](marketlab/convex/marketData.ts) / [`screener.ts`](marketlab/convex/screener.ts). This also surfaced genuine defects: fundamentals returned without `instrumentId`, and `StoredScreenerRow.instrumentType` widened to `string`.
2. **CORS-blind health probe** — the gate probed `/version`, which sends no CORS headers, so a healthy backend read as "offline". [`backend.ts`](marketlab/src/lib/backend.ts) now probes `POST /api/query` (CORS-enabled; a 4xx proves Convex answered without writing) and falls back to an opaque `no-cors` `/version` fetch.
3. **Online render before client existed** — one render had `status: online` with a null client, mounting `RootProvider` without `ConvexAuthProvider` (`Cannot destructure property 'isLoading' of 'useConvexAuth(...)'`). [`main.tsx`](marketlab/src/main.tsx) now keeps the connecting screen until the client exists.
4. **App-wide remount on every re-render** — `App` wrapped its pages in a provider component defined inside its render body, giving it a new identity each render and remounting every page. [`App.tsx`](marketlab/src/App.tsx) renders `RootProvider` / `OfflineRootProvider` directly.
5. **Dropdowns collided** — instruments were keyed by bare symbol, and `RELIANCE`/`TCS` exist on NSE **and** BSE, so React reused the wrong option rows and selecting a watchlist wiped the chosen instrument. [`Watchlists.tsx`](marketlab/src/pages/Watchlists.tsx) keys by canonical id; [`select.tsx`](marketlab/src/components/ui/select.tsx) is now fully controlled instead of keeping a drifting private copy.

Debug counters (`__appRenders`, `__wlMounts`) were removed; `grep` for `DBG_`/`console.log` in `src`, `convex`, `tests` returns nothing.

