- [appStability.test.tsx](marketlab/tests/appStability.test.tsx) — 2 tests asserting a re-render of `App` preserves DOM/tree state. **Verified as a real regression test**: temporarily restoring the old inline-provider shape makes it fail (`expected false to be true`), and it passes again with the fix.
