**Conditional go.** Backend connectivity, schema validation, authentication, session restoration, ownership enforcement and the persistence contracts Phase 3 will build on (profiles, paper accounts, watchlists, saved screeners, chart preferences) are all verified. What is *not* verified is any real market data.

