Phase 5 is implemented and verified. Here's the full report.

## What I found in the audit

Working before this phase: dashboard, markets explorer, instrument detail with charts/indicators, paper trading (orders, cancellation, ledger), screener with saved screens, strategies/backtests, profile, data sources. Genuinely missing or broken:

- **No global instrument search** anywhere in the shell.
- **No alerts feature at all** — only a `notificationPreferences.priceAlerts` flag with nothing behind it.
- **Watchlists** were a bare list: no quotes, no sorting, `prompt()`-based rename, no click-through to detail.
- **Portfolio** tables had no sorting or filtering; a 25-row cap with no way to narrow it.
- **Profile** dead-ended for signed-out users ("Please sign in") and saved the name on every keystroke.
- **Strategies was permanently stuck on "Loading instruments…"** against a demo-only catalogue (real bug: seeded rows have no `instrumentId`, so no draft was ever built).
- **Health probe logged a 400 every 30 s** — an empty-path `/api/query` POST used as the reachability proof.
- Screener had saved screens but no presets.

## Implemented

**Global search** — `⌘K`/`Ctrl+K` dialog with debounced server search, arrow-key/Enter/Escape handling, `role="combobox"`/`listbox`, explicit no-results text. Falls back to the deterministic sample catalogue offline and says so.

**Alerts (new subsystem)** — `priceAlerts` table, `convex/alerts.ts` (list/create/status/re-arm/remove + an evaluation action), and an Alerts page. Evaluation is **manual** ("Check now") because this deployment has no scheduler or delivery channel — stated in the UI. The action fetches quotes server-side and applies them through an internal mutation; the browser never supplies a price. Every row stores the price, source and freshness label used, and a SAMPLE-based trigger is marked "SAMPLE price — not a real market move".

**Watchlists** — per-instrument quotes with data-mode badges, sortable columns (symbol/price/change/added, missing values last), inline rename replacing `prompt()`, reordering via a new `watchlists.move` mutation, quick "Chart" links, and a search-driven add picker using canonical ids.

**Portfolio** — sortable positions (value/P&L/qty/avg cost/symbol), order status filter + sort, ledger side filter, with filtered-empty messages. Pure helpers live in `src/lib/tableSort.ts`.

**Dashboard customisation** — per-user section toggles (indices/top stocks/watchlist/movers) stored in `userProfiles.dashboardSections` and applied on load.

**Screener presets** — Gainers, Losers, Large cap, Low P/E, Liquid; each pre-fills documented filters and runs immediately, server re-validates.

**Profile** — AuthPanel for signed-out users, explicit "Save name" instead of per-keystroke writes, proper `fieldset` for notification flags with an honest note that no delivery exists.

**Console hygiene** — the health probe now tries `/version` opaquely first (no console error), falling back to the `/api/query` 400 proof only if that's blocked.

**Error hygiene** — new `friendlyError()` strips Convex `[CONVEX M(...)] [Request ID] … Uncaught Error:` wrappers so server internals don't render in the UI.

## Files changed

Backend: [schema.ts](marketlab/convex/schema.ts), [alerts.ts](marketlab/convex/alerts.ts) (new), [users.ts](marketlab/convex/users.ts), [watchlists.ts](marketlab/convex/watchlists.ts), [backtests.ts](marketlab/convex/backtests.ts).

Frontend: [GlobalSearch.tsx](marketlab/src/components/system/GlobalSearch.tsx) (new), [Alerts.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Alerts.tsx) (new), [Watchlists.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Watchlists.tsx), [Portfolio.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Portfolio.tsx), [Dashboard.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx), [Profile.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Profile.tsx), [Screener.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Screener.tsx), [Strategies.tsx](marketlab/src/pages/Strategies.tsx), [App.tsx](marketlab/src/App.tsx), [RootContext.tsx](marketlab/src/context/RootContext.tsx), [backend.ts](marketlab/src/lib/backend.ts), plus new [search.ts](marketlab/src/lib/search.ts), [tableSort.ts](marketlab/src/lib/tableSort.ts), [alerts.ts](marketlab/src/lib/alerts.ts), [errors.ts](marketlab/src/lib/errors.ts), and [globals.css](marketlab/src/styles/globals.css).

Tests: [search.test.ts](marketlab/tests/search.test.ts) (19), [portfolioTables.test.ts](marketlab/tests/portfolioTables.test.ts) (12), [globalSearch.test.tsx](marketlab/tests/globalSearch.test.tsx) (7), and [backendState.test.ts](marketlab/tests/backendState.test.ts) updated for the new probe order.

